  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You flicker rapidly in and out of reality, making it impossible for your foes to punish you for your audacious maneuvers.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dimensional Maneuvers<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the bonus on combat maneuver checks granted by this feat. Your combat maneuvers made while benefiting from Dimensional Maneuvers do not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc92\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
